ine-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/01a9cc82506cfcfdbffb8b8fbeb6fd20.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">07 &ndash; Na pagina inicial, clique em &ldquo;consultar procedimento&rdquo;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/35db3a602b05927854dc00ac9d921e21.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">08 &ndash; no campo &ldquo;digite o c&oacute;digo do procedimento&rdquo;, insira o c&oacute;digo &ldquo;<u>0014</u>&rdquo; (sem aspas):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\"><img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/e6389952a3346577b7a492b868d408df.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">09 &ndash; ap&oacute;s clicar em &ldquo;consultar&rdquo;, clique em &ldquo;visualizar&rdquo;:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/286736bc157e979d13ea3f60e412535d.jpg\" width=\"820\" height=\"477\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">10 &ndash; Na aba &ldquo;documentos em anexo&rdquo; podem ser visualizados todos documentos escaneados e juntados no processo administrativo.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/3e698adea557ae2cf99b2b7f36918e0a.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">11 &ndash; na aba &ldquo;documentos gerados&rdquo; s&atilde;o visualizados todos documentos produzidos no pr&oacute;prio sistema. </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/9320d5b4d16a78810bb2122453543ad1.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">Obs:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">1 &ndash; N&atilde;o h&aacute; registro no sistema de quando o MP acessar&aacute; o mesmo. Portanto, o acesso liberado ao MP &eacute; confidencial, e n&atilde;o gerar&aacute; nenhum tipo de registro;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">2 &ndash; O acesso est&aacute; pr&eacute;-liberado ao email <a href=\"mailto:pjmuzambinho@mpmg.mg.br\">pjmuzambinho@mpmg.mg.br</a>, caso V. S. requeira libera&ccedil;&atilde;o por outro e-mail, &eacute; s&oacute; solicitar em <a href=\"mailto:reurb@juruaia.mg.gov.br\">reurb@juruaia.mg.gov.br</a>. </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">3 &ndash; O processo administrativo s&oacute; ser&aacute; conclu&iacute;do com a expedi&ccedil;&atilde;o da Certid&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, portanto, podem ser anexados v&aacute;rios documentos antes da expedi&ccedil;&atilde;o da CRF. </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">4 &ndash; A Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria se coloca &agrave; disposi&ccedil;&atilde;o deste r. MP, para quaiquer esclarecimentos e/ou cumprimento de determina&ccedil;&otilde;es e/ou orienta&ccedil;&otilde;es.</span></strong></p>\r\n<br><br></div>','ofício nº 195 MP Muzambinho',1,'2022-07-14 14:49:46','08:31:10','2022-07-15 08:31:10',20),(18,'0014',NULL,'2','3','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"col-12\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"\" src=\"../../assets/icones/325-Reurb-E.png\" width=\"200\"><br><img class=\"\" src=\"../../assets/icones/204-Reurb-S.png\" width=\"300\"></div>\r\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Of&iacute;cio Geral n&ordm; Of&iacute;cio Geral n&ordm; 196/2022/CRF (Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria)</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"conteudo\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Ao Ilmo.&nbsp; Sr (a) <strong>Humberto Gomes do Amaral</strong></p>\r\nTitutar do <strong>Cartorio de Registro de Im&oacute;veis de Muzambinho</strong><br><br><br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Ref: <strong>Comunica&ccedil;&atilde;o de instaura&ccedil;ao do procedimento de Regulariza&ccedil;ao Fundi&aacute;ria e solicita&ccedil;&atilde;o de certid&atilde;o de matr&iacute;culas.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right; line-height: normal;\" align=\"right\">Juruaia, 14 de julho de 2022</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-indent: 35.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Taize Marcelino Martins Costa, </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Presidente da Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria Urbana, nomeada pelo Decreto n&ordm; 1.355-A, de 31 de Maio de 2021, vem, com o devido respeito, para, na forma da Lei Complementar Municipal n&ordm; 59 de 26 de Maio de 2021, da Lei Federal n&ordm; 13.465/17, e do Decreto Municipal n&ordm; 1.355/21, primeiramente <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u>informar a este respeit&aacute;vel cart&oacute;rio</u></strong>, que o Munic&iacute;pio de Juruaia, atrav&eacute;s da Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, iniciou de of&iacute;cio, atrav&eacute;s da Portaria n&ordm; 552 de 26 de Agosto de 2021, os procedimentos para regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria do bairro com ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o irregular chamado provisoriamente de &ldquo;Bairro Barra Mansa&rdquo;. <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Considerando a possibilidade legal de procedimentos parciais, demos continuidade no n&uacute;cleo indicado no estudo t&eacute;cnico preliminar conforme processo eletr&ocirc;nico, delimitado como &ldquo;Barra Mansa 02&rdquo;.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-indent: 35.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Assim, vem com o devido respeito, al&eacute;m de informar, requerer emiss&atilde;o de certid&atilde;o das matr&iacute;culas de origem atingidas pela regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria, a saber, n&ordm;s <span style=\"background-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\">15.975, 10.458 e 15.889,</span> para fins de notifica&ccedil;&atilde;o de poss&iacute;veis propriet&aacute;rios constantes nas matr&iacute;culas;</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-indent: 35.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Informamos, a tempo, que todo passo agora poder&aacute; ser acompanhado por este r. cart&oacute;rio, com consulta de toda documenta&ccedil;&atilde;o produzida no processo administrativo, no seguinte endere&ccedil;o eletr&ocirc;nico:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://e-reurbjuruaia.com.br/\">https://e-reurbjuruaia.com.br/</a>, com o <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u>c&oacute;digo do procedimento n&ordm; 0014</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 35.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Para isso, V. S,. devem seguir a orienta&ccedil;&atilde;o neste of&iacute;cio para acesso.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Diante do Exposto, requer:</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">a) CERTID&Atilde;O DAS MATR&Iacute;CULAS <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u>15.975, 10.458 e 15.889</u></strong>, conforme indicado acima, para localizar o nome dos parceladores/empreendedores irregulares que deram origem ao n&uacute;cleo urbano informal, e as respectivas matr&iacute;culas dos confrontantes descritos no per&iacute;metro, bem como titulares de direitos nas matr&iacute;culas, para fins de notifica&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">b) Indicar se h&aacute; matr&iacute;cula(s) localizada(s) em nome de terceiros, bem como as matr&iacute;culas/transcri&ccedil;&otilde;es dos confrontantes descritos no per&iacute;metro;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">c) Indicar, expressamente, se h&aacute; outros titulares de direitos reais presentes na(s) matr&iacute;cula(s) localizada(s) e atingidas pelo per&iacute;metro em quest&atilde;o e/ou na(s) matr&iacute;cula(s) dos confrontantes, sendo encaminhada(s) certid&atilde;o(&otilde;es) de inteiro teor ou em relat&oacute;rio para apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o ao Munic&iacute;pio.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">d) A presente solicita&ccedil;&atilde;o requer a busca da forma mais abrangente poss&iacute;vel, junto ao Registro de Im&oacute;veis, referente ao im&oacute;vel, fornecendo os dados necess&aacute;rios:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">- Busca pelo indicador real: nomes dos logradouros atingidos pelo per&iacute;metro do n&uacute;cleo urbano informal objeto da regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria, tais como nomes das ruas, avenidas, alamedas, travessas, pra&ccedil;as, dentre outros, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u>se houver</u></strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">- Busca pelo indicador pessoal: nomes e cadastros de pessoas f&iacute;sicas ou jur&iacute;dicas de todos os propriet&aacute;rios com matr&iacute;culas atingidas no n&uacute;cleo a ser regularizado, bem como o nome de todos os confrontantes/confinantes do referido per&iacute;metro.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 35.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">E tudo que este r. Cart&oacute;rio entender ser necess&aacute;rio pelo superior conhecimento do r. oficial e servidores.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 35.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Desde j&aacute;, menciona e requer a isen&ccedil;&atilde;o do pagamento de emolumentos, nos termos do art. 13, &sect;1&ordm;, da Lei 13.465/17.</span></u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Nestes termos, pede deferimento, com protestos da mais alta estima e considera&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">Taize Marcelino Martins Costa</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">Presidente da Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria Urbana de Juruaia</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">PASSO A PASSO PARA ACOMPANHAR O PROCEDIMENTO REURB &ndash; BARRA MANSA 02:</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\"><strong>01 &ndash; Acesse o sistema e-reurb Juruaia em</strong> <a href=\"https://e-reurbjuruaia.com.br/\">https://e-reurbjuruaia.com.br/</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/084bbfd94c65270e38d4b5433691c0ca.jpg\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"><br><!--[endif]--></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">02 &ndash; inserir o e-mail do cart&oacute;rio </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; color: #212529; background: white;\"><a href=\"mailto:rimuzambinho@yahoo.com.br\">rimuzambinho@yahoo.com.br</a> </span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>e &ldquo;esqueci a senha&rdquo;.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/87d8dda109ec34102452d80da91f2f90.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"><br><!--[endif]--></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">03 &ndash; repetir o email, e clicar em &ldquo;enviar&rdquo;.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:rect id=\"Retângulo_x0020_13\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s2052\"\r\n style=\'position:absolute;margin-left:39.9pt;margin-top:134.9pt;width:177.6pt;\r\n height:19.8pt;z-index:251660288;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;\r\n mso-wrap-distance-left:9pt;mso-wrap-distance-top:0;mso-wrap-distance-right:9pt;\r\n mso-wrap-distance-bottom:0;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\r\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:text;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\r\n mso-position-vertical-relative:text;v-text-anchor: