fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/350bcc6e44119945ba9295e1324b2022.jpg\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/097bcd48b2998fdc96fddde68c783154.jpg\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">DOS MEMORIAIS DESCRITIVOS</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">O engenheiro respons&aacute;vel anexou ao processo administrativo os memoriais descritivos por Quadra, conforme documento no evento </span><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">(documento 587)</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">, e tamb&eacute;m anexado a este projeto, do qual concluiu:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Quadra A - 12 lotes. propriet&aacute;rios/posseiros:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">1 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">2 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">3 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">4 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">5 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">6 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">7 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">8 - sem identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">9 - Renato Fernandes da Silva - CPF: 044.156.776-22</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">10 - Ademar Mazurega - CPF: 694.229.236-20</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">11 - Dinalva Aparecida Gomes da Silva - CPF:060.494.906-51, casada com Reinaldo Gon&ccedil;alves da Silva - CPF:043.506.956-05</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">12 - PREFEITURA MUNICIPAL DE JURUAIA-MG, Atrav&eacute;s de processo administrativo de Desapropria&ccedil;&atilde;o extrajudicial aberto pelo Decreto n&ordm; 1539/2022 - CNPJ: 18.668.368/0001-98</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o e concord&acirc;ncia de posse.</span></u></em></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Ap&oacute;s trabalho de identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o de propriet&aacute;rios/possuidores, foi realizado o trabalho de busca de assinaturas e concord&acirc;ncias.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Ressalva-se o direito de atribui&ccedil;&atilde;o posterior de dom&iacute;nio, pelo Munic&iacute;pio, aos ocupantes que n&atilde;o tenham constado na listagem inicial, mediante cadastramento complementar, conforme regra o Art. 23, &sect;6&ordm; da Lei 13.465/17, inclusive, conforme determinou o r. prefeito em decis&atilde;o homologat&oacute;ria, com possibilidade de nova avalia&ccedil;&atilde;o documental para classifica&ccedil;&atilde;o se social ou espec&iacute;fico.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">O n&uacute;cleo foi formado em (01) quatro quadras denominadas, ap&oacute;s o levantamento, de A, com 12 lotes.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Atrav&eacute;s do sistema e-reurb, (aba \"gerar documentos\") foi colhidas as assinaturas, conforme comprova&ccedil;&atilde;o:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">LOTE 09 - RENATO FERNANDES DA SILVA -&nbsp; Documentos s&oacute;cio econ&ocirc;mico e comprova&ccedil;&atilde;o de posse no evento (documento 208 do sistema).</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/14648d82b8ea85ff070b03876834b3a7.jpg\"><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">LOTE 10 - ADEMAR MAZUREGA-&nbsp; Documentos s&oacute;cio econ&ocirc;mico e comprova&ccedil;&atilde;o de posse no evento (documento&nbsp; do sistema).</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\"><img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/0ae38e47090fb15238cced5a22038af0.jpg\"></span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">LOTE 11 - DINALVA APARECIDA GOMES DA SILVA E REINALDO GON&Ccedil;ALVES DA SILVA -&nbsp; Documentos s&oacute;cio econ&ocirc;mico e comprova&ccedil;&atilde;o de posse no evento (documento 206/207 do sistema).</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\"><img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/4cdd3bfdbfac8d00c707c8b755900f58.jpg\"></span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; background: #FBEEB8; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">LOTE 12 - PREFEITURA DE JURUAIA-&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; background: white; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Conforme processo administrativo anexado integralmente no evento (<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">documento 95</strong>) o referido im&oacute;vel foi objeto de desapropria&ccedil;&atilde;o por parte do poder p&uacute;blico por interesse p&uacute;blico, tendo em vista que no local j&aacute; se encontra constru&iacute;do uma elevat&oacute;ria para ETE (Esta&ccedil;&atilde;o de tratamento de esgotos).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; background: white; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">A constru&ccedil;&atilde;o se deu a muitos anos, j&aacute; consolidada. Por se tratar de &aacute;rea totalmente dentro de APP, considerando o interesse p&uacute;blico, o im&oacute;vel passa a ser de propriedade da prefeitura municipal de Juruaia.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">DO ACESSO INTEGRAL AOS DOCUMENTOS</span></u></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Segue abaixo o passo a passo para que o Cart&oacute;rio de Registro de Im&oacute;veis e o Minist&eacute;rio P&uacute;blico dos quais o munic&iacute;pio de Juruaia &eacute; vinculado possam ter acesso integral aos documentos do procedimento que porventura n&atilde;o forem anexados ao PRF e &agrave; CRF:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Importante frisar que o acesso pelo CRI ou MP n&atilde;o gera nenhum tipo de registro no sistema, e n&atilde;o h&aacute; possibilidade de altera&ccedil;&otilde;es, apenas para fins de consulta e visualiza&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">01 &ndash; o sistema deve ser acessado em </span><a href=\"../../login\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">https://e-reurbsistema.com.br/sistema/login</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/915e32df1567aa09adfb8cd0978302e5.jpg\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">02 &ndash; inserir o e-mail fornecido &agrave; prefeitura de Juruaia e &ldquo;esqueci a senha&rdquo;. (ou, se j&aacute; tiver a senha cadastrada, insira os dados de acesso.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/8d971357aabe1694da5b5d78605db044.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">03 &ndash; repetir o email, e clicar em &ldquo;enviar&rdquo;. (no caso de ter esquecido a senha).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/b801c08ae1c8d052922215ede241232f.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">04 &ndash; Na caixa de e-mail, clique no link para gerar uma senha: (no caso de ter esquecido a senha)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/ca8fd65806593733e6d4b82afa284287.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">05 &ndash; Na p&aacute;gina que abrir, crie uma senha pessoal: (para o caso de ter esquecido a senha)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/d92674aa4bd3bea7d552d95cb7252a54.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">06 &ndash; Ap&oacute;s, fa&ccedil;a login com e-mail e senha:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/2f66556e0e87bf877fd9c886f907b2e9.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">07 &ndash; Na p&aacute;gina inicial, clique em &ldquo;procedimentos&rdquo;.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/bff98fa6b4a32eb6078c8544d0082738.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">08 &ndash; no campo &ldquo;digite o c&oacute;digo do procedimento&rdquo;, insira o c&oacute;digo &ldquo;945058907&rdquo; (sem aspas): </span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/1b0e15744d5a11471982273591203b66.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">09 &ndash; ap&oacute;s clicar em &ldquo;consultar&rdquo;, clique em &ldquo;visualizar&rdquo;:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\"><img src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/a78553eae3dcbc0808ad8c4e10174eaf.jpg\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">10 &ndash; Na aba &ldquo;documentos em anexo&rdquo; podem ser visualizados todos documentos escaneados e juntados no processo administrativo.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/4e5628cebd499b2a02dad639e98a6c51.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">11 &ndash; na aba &ldquo;documentos gerados&rdquo; s&atilde;o visualizados todos documentos produzidos no pr&oacute;prio sistema. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/776948bf37b85b1486b2d8edac8befa7.jpg\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">CERTID&Atilde;O DE CRONOGRAMA PREVISTO NO &sect;1&ordm; DO ART. 10 DA LEI COMPLEMENTAR MUNICIPAL 59/21</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Conforme normativa prevista na Lei Complementar Municipal n&ordm; 59/21 que regulamenta no &acirc;mbito municipal a Reurb, foi emitida minuta de certid&atilde;o do cronograma previsto no &sect;1&ordm; do Art. 10, para assinatura do Exmo. Prefeito, concluindo o poder p&uacute;blico municipal pela implementa&ccedil;&atilde;o da infraestrutura faltante no n&uacute;cleo, a saber, energia el&eacute;trica individual, complementa&ccedil;&atilde;o e melhoria no sistema de esgoto, meio fio, e pavimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o (asf&aacute;ltica ou outra modalidade), no prazo m&aacute;ximo de 10 anos.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Sugerimos que o poder executivo deve se empenhar em anualmente implementar no m&iacute;nimo alguma porcentagem da infraestrutura, realizando-a progressivamente.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left: 44.25pt; mso-add-space: auto;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\"> </span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-no-proof: yes;\">DA NOTA T&Eacute;CNICA N&ordm; 02/2023 &ndash; DO CORI &ndash; COL&Eacute;GIO REGISTRAL IMOBILI&Aacute;RIO DE MINAS GERAIS</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Considerando o teor da Nota T&eacute;cnica n&ordm; 02/2023, em que deixa claro que os dados essenciais para buscas imobili&aacute;rias s&atilde;o obtidos, em sua maioria, na fase de cadastro de ocupantes (etapa contida na fase 2, de processamento) e na fase 3 (elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o do projeto de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria) e n&atilde;o na fase de instaura&ccedil;&atilde;o da Reurb (in&iacute;cio da fase 2); (art. 31 da Lei n&ordm; 13.465/2017), e que as buscas podem e devem perdurar durante todo o processamento da Reurb no munic&iacute;pio e na fase registral perante o cart&oacute;rio, exige-se amplo di&aacute;logo institucional entre cart&oacute;rio e Munic&iacute;pio, a Comiss&atilde;o de <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria do Munic&iacute;pio de Juruaia sugere ao Exmo. Prefeito, que, quando da emiss&atilde;o da CRF e do of&iacute;cio para registro, mencione a solicita&ccedil;&atilde;o por novas buscas para:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">1 &ndash; Isen&ccedil;&atilde;o pela Reurb-S somente a quem n&atilde;o foi beneficiado ainda (art. 13, &sect;1&ordm;, I)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">2 &ndash; Nova confer&ecirc;ncia sobre o que as buscas t&ecirc;m como objetivo identificar (art. 28, II, e art. 31, &sect;&sect;1&ordm; e 2&ordm; da Lei n&ordm; 13.465/2017):</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 80px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Origem do parcelamento irregular;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 80px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Matr&iacute;culas ou transcri&ccedil;&otilde;es dos confrontantes do per&iacute;metro externo ao n&uacute;cleo regularizado (confrontantes que figuram no per&iacute;metro da matr&iacute;cula matriz); </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 80px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Exist&ecirc;ncia de matr&iacute;culas ou transcri&ccedil;&otilde;es atualmente em nome dos ocupantes com condi&ccedil;&atilde;o para expedi&ccedil;&atilde;o do t&iacute;tulo de legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria em Reurb-S;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 80px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Propriet&aacute;rios de im&oacute;veis regulares no per&iacute;metro interno do n&uacute;cleo;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; padding-left: 80px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Outros titulares de direitos reais nas matr&iacute;culas de origem, dos confrontantes e das matr&iacute;culas regulares no per&iacute;metro.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">E, se for o caso, emitir nota de devolu&ccedil;&atilde;o para as dilig&ecirc;ncias cab&iacute;veis.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">CONCLUS&Atilde;O</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">A Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria do Munic&iacute;pio de Juruaia conclui, portanto, que a poligonal definida como &ldquo;Barra Mansa 03&rdquo; est&aacute; apta a ser regularizada na parcial apresentada, mediante <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u>Legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria</u></strong> atrav&eacute;s da Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria por interesse Social &ndash; Reurb-S, cuja &aacute;rea se encontra localizada em &aacute;rea consolidada e dotada de parcial infraestrutura b&aacute;sica, com termo de responsabilidade do Munic&iacute;pio a implementar gradualmente nos termos da Lei. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Como solu&ccedil;&atilde;o proposta de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o jur&iacute;dica registral da parcial do bairro &ldquo;Barra Mansa 03&rdquo;, &eacute; ABERTURA DE MATR&Iacute;CULAS INDIVIDUALIZADAS (Art. 44, &sect;1&ordm;, II da Lei 13.465/17), mediante o parcelamento apresentado, por quadras e lotes, visto que foram identificados alguns dos propriet&aacute;rios (ressalvado o direito de atribui&ccedil;&atilde;o posterior de dom&iacute;nio, pelo Munic&iacute;pio, aos ocupantes que n&atilde;o tenham constado na listagem inicial, mediante cadastramento complementar, conforme regra o Art. 23, &sect;6&ordm; da Lei 13.465/17, mesmo que esse seja por Reurb-S) definindo as divis&otilde;es conforme situa&ccedil;&atilde;o de ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o demonstrada, transferindo a propriedade da unidade a cada ocupante, com destina&ccedil;&atilde;o urbana livre e desembara&ccedil;ada de quaisquer &ocirc;nus, direitos reais, gravames ou inscri&ccedil;&otilde;es eventualmente existentes nas matr&iacute;culas de origem, conforme disp&otilde;e o &sect;2&ordm; do Art. 23 da Lei 13.465/17.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Em conson&acirc;ncia com o Art. 22, &sect;6&ordm; da Lei 13.465/17, a &aacute;rea remanescente da matr&iacute;cula do im&oacute;vel atingido deve ser apurada e realizada a retifica&ccedil;&atilde;o por responsabilidade de seus propriet&aacute;rios.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Considerando a quantidade de possuidores e lotes, o &sect;5&ordm; do Art. 23 da Lei 13.465/17 prev&ecirc; a dispensa de apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o dos t&iacute;tulos (contratos e documentos) individualizados, sendo suficiente apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o ao CRI este projeto, os memoriais separados e a certid&atilde;o de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o e aprova&ccedil;&atilde;o pelo prefeito, apesar da inova&ccedil;&atilde;o trazida, a saber, o acesso integral aos documentos pelo Cart&oacute;rio de Im&oacute;veis, ao sistema E-Reurb, mencionado no Projeto.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">As edifica&ccedil;&otilde;es existentes n&atilde;o s&atilde;o objeto de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o neste PRF, no entanto, em alguns dos memoriais descritivos, tentou-se informar, por mera not&iacute;cia, as &aacute;reas de constru&ccedil;&atilde;o para constar na titula&ccedil;&atilde;o e posteriormente nas matr&iacute;culas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">N&atilde;o &eacute; necess&aacute;rio projeto de lei para inclus&atilde;o do n&uacute;cleo definido em per&iacute;metro urbano atrav&eacute;s de Lei, conforme disp&otilde;e a Lei Org&acirc;nica Municipal, visto o mesmo j&aacute; estar dentro do per&iacute;metro, conforme comprovado.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Reiteramos ainda, a sugest&atilde;o para que o Poder Executivo se empenhe ao m&aacute;ximo, atrav&eacute;s de recursos pr&oacute;prios ou de conv&ecirc;nios com os governos Federal e Estadual, para implementa&ccedil;&atilde;o eficiente e r&aacute;pida da infraestrutura faltante no n&uacute;cleo.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Por fim, orientamos que ao CRI seja solicitado no of&iacute;cio, que seja cumprido o disposto (para que haja busca quanto aos benefici&aacute;rios e c&ocirc;njuges, para verifica&ccedil;&atilde;o se n&atilde;o h&aacute; impedimento de beneficiamento ao Reurb-S, caso j&aacute; tenham sido beneficiados )</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Por fim, os trabalhos da Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria neste procedimento parcial finda-se, estando &agrave; disposi&ccedil;&atilde;o do r. prefeito para eventuais esclarecimentos e produ&ccedil;&atilde;o de documentos e esclarecimentos que o r. cart&oacute;rio de im&oacute;veis solicitar.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Reservamos no direito de a qualquer momento, produzir novos dados, reiterar documenta&ccedil;&otilde;es, responder &oacute;rg&atilde;os, sob responsabilidade da equipe. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Os dados foram tratados com o devido sigilo conforme determina a legisla&ccedil;&atilde;o atual.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Reservamos no direito ainda de corrigir poss&iacute;veis dados com erros, erros de digita&ccedil;&atilde;o, equ&iacute;voco ou outro sem dolo da equipe e Comiss&atilde;o Reurb Juruaia.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Equipe de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria de Juruaia </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18pt; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt; tab-stops: 77.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>G<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">LOSS&Aacute;RIO</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">N&uacute;cleo urbano:</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> assentamento humano, com uso e caracter&iacute;sticas urbanas, constitu&iacute;do por unidades imobili&aacute;rias de &aacute;rea inferior &agrave; fra&ccedil;&atilde;o m&iacute;nima de parcelamento prevista na </span><a href=\"http://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/LEIS/L5868.htm\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Lei n&ordm; 5.868, de 12 de dezembro de 1972</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">, independentemente da propriedade do solo, ainda que situado em &aacute;rea qualificada ou inscrita como rural; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">N&uacute;cleo urbano informal:</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> aquele clandestino, irregular ou no qual n&atilde;o foi poss&iacute;vel realizar, por qualquer modo, a titula&ccedil;&atilde;o de seus ocupantes, ainda que atendida a legisla&ccedil;&atilde;o vigente &agrave; &eacute;poca de sua implanta&ccedil;&atilde;o ou regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">N&uacute;cleo urbano informal consolidado:</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> aquele de dif&iacute;cil revers&atilde;o, considerados o tempo da ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o, a natureza das edifica&ccedil;&otilde;es, a localiza&ccedil;&atilde;o das vias de circula&ccedil;&atilde;o e a presen&ccedil;a de equipamentos p&uacute;blicos, entre outras circunst&acirc;ncias a serem avaliadas pelo Munic&iacute;pio; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Demarca&ccedil;&atilde;o urban&iacute;stica:</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> procedimento destinado a identificar os im&oacute;veis p&uacute;blicos e privados abrangidos pelo n&uacute;cleo urbano informal e a obter a anu&ecirc;ncia dos respectivos titulares de direitos inscritos na matr&iacute;cula dos im&oacute;veis ocupados, culminando com averba&ccedil;&atilde;o na matr&iacute;cula destes im&oacute;veis da viabilidade da regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria, a ser promovida a crit&eacute;rio do Munic&iacute;pio; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Certid&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria (CRF):</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> documento expedido pelo Munic&iacute;pio ao final do procedimento da Reurb, constitu&iacute;do do projeto de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria aprovado, do termo de compromisso relativo a sua execu&ccedil;&atilde;o e, no caso da legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria e da legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o de posse, da listagem dos ocupantes do n&uacute;cleo urbano informal regularizado, da devida qualifica&ccedil;&atilde;o destes e dos direitos reais que lhes foram conferidos; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o de posse:</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> ato do poder p&uacute;blico destinado a conferir t&iacute;tulo, por meio do qual fica reconhecida a posse de im&oacute;vel objeto da Reurb, convers&iacute;vel em aquisi&ccedil;&atilde;o de direito real de propriedade na forma desta Lei, com a identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o de seus ocupantes, do tempo da ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o e da natureza da posse; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria:</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> mecanismo de reconhecimento da aquisi&ccedil;&atilde;o origin&aacute;ria do direito real de propriedade sobre unidade imobili&aacute;ria objeto da Reurb; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Ocupante:</span></u></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"> aquele que mant&eacute;m poder de fato sobre lote ou fra&ccedil;&atilde;o ideal de terras p&uacute;blicas ou privadas em n&uacute;cleos urbanos informais. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span><a name=\"_Toc309307187\"></a><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-ansi-language: PT-BR;\">REFER&Ecirc;NCIAS</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">ATUI, Elias Dimas. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Direito da usucapi&atilde;o cartorial e judicial</strong> &ndash; Teoria e pr&aacute;tica jur&iacute;dica &ndash; Leme, SP: Rumo<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Jur&iacute;dico, 2022.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">CARNEIRO, Isaac Newton. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Manual de direito municipal brasileiro. </strong>2 ed. amp. e rev. / Isaac Newton Carneiro &ndash; Salvador: Edi&ccedil;&atilde;o do Autor, 2018.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">CUNHA, Michelly Freire Fonseca. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Manual de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria urbana &ndash; REURB.</strong> 2&ordf; edi&ccedil;&atilde;o revisada e ampliada &ndash; S&atilde;o Paulo: Editora Juspodivm, 2021.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">DA SILVA, Jos&eacute; Afonso. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Direito Urban&iacute;stico Brasileiro</strong>. 7&ordf; Edi&ccedil;&atilde;o. S&atilde;o Paulo: Malheiros Editores, 2015.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">JUSTEN FILHO, Mar&ccedil;al. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Curso de Direito Administrativo, 14 ed.</strong> Rio de Janeiro: Forense, 2023.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">K&Uuml;STER, Percy Jos&eacute; Cleve. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria Urbana: do caos &agrave; dignidade, da teoria &agrave; pr&aacute;tica, 1&ordf; ed.</strong> &ndash; S&atilde;o Paulo: YK Editora, 2021.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">MACEDO, Paola de Castro Ribeiro. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria urbana e seus mecanismos de titula&ccedil;&atilde;o dos ocupantes: Lei n&ordm; 13.465/2017 e Decreto n&ordm; 9.310/2018 &ndash; </strong>2&ordf; ed. rev., atual. e ampl. &ndash; S&atilde;o Paulo, SP: Thompson Reuters Brasil, 2022.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">MEIRELLES, Hely Lopes. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Direito municipal brasileiro. </strong>19. ed. / autorizada por Giovani da Silva Corralo &ndash; S&atilde;o Paulo: Malheiros, 2021.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">MIRANDA, Maur&iacute;cio da Silva, e CASTRO, Rafael Assed de. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Manual do Procurador do Munic&iacute;pio &ndash; Teoria e pr&aacute;tica</strong>. 9&ordf; ed. rev., atual. e ampl. Salvador: Editora Juspodivm, 2021.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">OLIVEIRA, Samuel Menezes. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria urbana &ndash; Teoria, aspectos pr&aacute;ticos, prote&ccedil;&atilde;o ambiental e <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">compliance</em> no processo de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria</strong> &ndash; S&atilde;o Paulo &ndash; Editora Dial&eacute;tica, 2022.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">OVANDO JUNIOR, Altivo. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria Urbana: Coment&aacute;rios &agrave; Lei n&ordm; 13.465 de 11 de julho de 2017, I ed.</strong> &ndash; Belo Horizonte, MG: Editora Del Rey, 2021.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">RODRIGUES, Carlos Alexandre. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Como lotear uma gleba &ndash; Parcelamento e desmembramento de solo, loteamento e condom&iacute;nio de lotes</strong> &ndash; Leme, SP: Editora Imperium, 2023.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">RICALDE, Mario do Carmo. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria Rural e Urbana: Impactos na Lei n&ordm; 13.465/2017.</strong> 2&ordf; ed. 2&ordf; tiragem&ndash; Campo Grande: Contemplar, 2019.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">SANTOS, Oz&eacute;ias J. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Manual dos Procuradores.</strong> 3&ordf; edi&ccedil;&atilde;o &ndash; Leme: Rumo Jur&iacute;dico, 2021.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">ABELHA, Andr&eacute;. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Lei 13.465 &ndash; Parte VI &ndash; Desmistificando a Reurb</strong>. Dispon&iacute;vel em <a href=\"https://www.migalhas.com.br/depeso/264717/lei-13-465-17--parte-vi---desmistificando-a-reurb\"><span style=\"color: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">https://www.migalhas.com.br/depeso/264717/lei-13-465-17--parte-vi---desmistificando-a-reurb</span></a>.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">LEGISLA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O FEDERAL </span></u></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">BRASIL. <strong>Constitui&ccedil;&atilde;o da Rep&uacute;blica Federativa do Brasil de 1988</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Decreto-Lei 58 de 1937</strong>, que disp&otilde;e sobre loteamento e a venda de terrenos para pagamento em presta&ccedil;&atilde;o. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Decreto-Lei 271 de 1967</strong>, que disp&otilde;e sobre loteamento urbano, responsabilidade do loteador, concess&atilde;o de uso e espa&ccedil;o a&eacute;reo e d&aacute; outras provid&ecirc;ncias. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 6.015 de 1973</strong>, que disp&otilde;e sobre os registros p&uacute;blicos, e d&aacute; outras provid&ecirc;ncias. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 6.766 de 1979</strong>, que disp&otilde;e sobre o parcelamento urbano. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 10.257 de 2001</strong>, que institui o Estatuto da Cidade. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Medida Provis&oacute;ria 2.220 de 2001</strong>, que institui a Concess&atilde;o de Uso Especial para fins de Moradia (CUEM). </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 10.406 de 2002</strong>, que institui o C&oacute;digo Civil. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 11.977 de 2009</strong>, que institui normas gerais sobre regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria urbana. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 12.424 de 2012</strong>, que introduz modifica&ccedil;&otilde;es na Lei Federal 11.977/2009. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 12.651 de 2012</strong>, que institui o C&oacute;digo Florestal. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Federal 13.465 de 2017</strong>, que disp&otilde;e sobre normas gerais da regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria rural e urbana. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"FormataodasReferncias\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Decreto Federal 9.310 de 2018</strong>, que regulamenta as disposi&ccedil;&otilde;es da Lei Federal 13.465/2017 sobre normas gerais da regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o fundi&aacute;ria rural e urbana.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><u><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">LEGISLA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O ESTADUAL </span></u></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">MINAS GERAIS. <strong>Decreto Estadual 44.464 de 2007</strong>, que disciplina o exame e anu&ecirc;ncia pr&eacute;via pelo Estado para aprova&ccedil;&atilde;o de projetos de loteamentos e desmembramentos de &aacute;reas para fins urbanos pelos munic&iacute;pios. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Decreto Estadual 46.027 de 2012</strong>, que regulamenta a Lei Complementar Estadual 122/2012. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. <strong>Lei Estadual 20.922 de 2013</strong>, que disp&otilde;e sobre as pol&iacute;ticas florestal e de prote&ccedil;&atilde;o &agrave; biodiversidade no Estado. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">________. </span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: PT-BR;\">Tribunal de Justi&ccedil;a de Minas Gerais. <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">PROVIMENTO CONJUNTO N&ordm; 93/2020</strong>, que codifica os atos normativos da Corregedoria-Geral de Justi&ccedil;a do Estado de Mina Gerais relativos aos servi&ccedil;os notariais e de registro.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">Realiza&ccedil;&atilde;o:</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/documentos/img/4217670d569df3f9961a257592d0ad4b.jpg\"></span>\r\n<p class=\"Default\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>','Projeto de Regularização Fundiária',1,'2023-11-07 14:30:45','20:33:21','2024-06-12 20:33:21',20);
INSERT INTO `docs` VALUES (138,'3421137111',NULL,'3','10','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"col-12\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"\" src=\"../../assets/icones/912-logo.png\" width=\"200\"></div>\r\n<p><br><br></p>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">CERTID&Atilde;O DE REGULARIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O FUNDI&Aacute;RIA N&ordm;001/2023</h1>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"conteudo\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">Eu, Nei Andr&eacute; Freire, Prefeito Municipal de Bom Jesus da Penha - MG, em pleno exerc&iacute;cio das atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es legais, e na forma da lei, nos termos dos artigos 30 e 41 da Lei n&ordm; 13.465/17 e art. 3&ordm; e 4&ordm; do Decreto n&ordm; 152/2023, e das leis municipais concernentes, CERTIFICO, para fins de registro imobili&aacute;rio, que tramitou perante a Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria deste Munic&iacute;pio o Procedimento Administrativo n&ordm;002358, o para fins de Legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, requerido por PAULO CESAR FARIA DA SILVA e PAULA ELISIANE DA SILVEIRA SILVA , procedimento ora finalizado por decis&atilde;o da Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, homologado neste ato, informando os seguintes requisitos existentes no referido procedimento:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 15px; text-align: justify;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">1. <strong>LOCALIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O: </strong>LOTE 14-A- QUADRA \"O\", RUA DIRETORA DONA TUNIQUINHA, N&deg; 1095, LOTEAMENTO NOVO HORIZONTE, na Cidade de Bom Jesus da Penha-MG, CEP: 37.948-000</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">2. <strong>LOTE MATRIZ: </strong>origem no&nbsp; livro n&deg; 02, Folha 01<strong>, </strong>M-4.349, LOTE 14-A, do CRI de Nova Resende-MG</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">3. <strong>MODALIDADE DA REGULARIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O: </strong>Reurb-E</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">4. <strong>RESPONSABILIDADE DE OBRAS E SERVI&Ccedil;OS:</strong> Desnecess&aacute;ria, tendo em vista que o lote j&aacute; possui a infraetrutura essencial para aprova&ccedil;&atilde;o do requerimento, a saber, encontram-se em &aacute;rea urbanizada, possuindo energia el&eacute;trica, &aacute;gua, passeio, pavimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o asf&aacute;ltica, servi&ccedil;o de recolhimento de lixo, sistema de liga&ccedil;&atilde;o de esgoto.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">5. <strong>PROJETO T&Eacute;CNICO DA REGULARIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O: </strong>Segue em anexo.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">6. <strong>LOTES REGULARIZADOS: </strong> O lote regularizado &eacute; o que faz parte do memorial descritivo, aprovado no projeto de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o, sendo o Lote 14-A, da Quadra O, constante da Matricula M-4.349, do CRI de Nova Resende, com &aacute;rea de 180,00 MTS&sup2;m&sup2;, situado no endere&ccedil;o RUA DIRETORA DONA TUNIQUINHA, n&ordm; 1095, bairro NOVO HORIZONTE, na cidade de BOM JESUS DA PENHA, Minas Gerais, com limites e confronta&ccedil;&otilde;es descritas no processo anexo, pendente de titula&ccedil;&atilde;o conforme situa&ccedil;&atilde;o atual, concedendo, por Legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, a titula&ccedil;&atilde;o ao SrPAULO CESAR FARIA DA SILVA e seu conjuge PAULA ELISIANE DA SILVEIRA SILVA, conforme requerido. </span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">7. A presente Certid&atilde;o vai acompanhada dos documentos oficiais e c&oacute;pia do procedimento administrativo.</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">Bom Jesus da Penha - MG, aos 08 de Novembro de 2023.</span></p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">Nei Andr&eacute; Freire</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">Prefeito Municipal</span></p>\r\n</div>','',1,'2023-11-08 10:50:45','14:18:17','2023-11-08 14:18:17',71),(139,'1532327238',NULL,'3','10','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"col-12\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img class=\"\" src=\"../../assets/icones/912-logo.png\" width=\"200\"></span></div>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">CERTID&Atilde;O DE REGULARIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O FUNDI&Aacute;RIA N&ordm;002/2023</span><br><br></h1>\r\n<div class=\"conteudo\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Eu, Nei Andr&eacute; Freire, Prefeito Municipal de Bom Jesus da Penha - MG, em pleno exerc&iacute;cio das atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es legais, e na forma da lei, nos termos dos artigos 30 e 41 da Lei n&ordm; 13.465/17 e art 3&ordm; e 4&ordm; do Decreto n&deg; 152/2023 e das leis municipais concernentes, CERTIFICO, para fins de registro imobili&aacute;rio, que tramitou perante a Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria deste Munic&iacute;pio o Procedimento Administrativo n&ordm;002357, o para fins de Legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, requerido por IVANEY FERREIRA CARDOSO, procedimento ora finalizado por decis&atilde;o da Comiss&atilde;o de Regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, homologado neste ato, informando os seguintes requisitos existentes no referido procedimento:</span></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 15px; text-align: justify;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">1. <strong>LOCALIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O: </strong>LOTE 05- QUADRA JB, RUA AMADO EVANGELISTA, BAIRRO NOVO HORIZONTE, na Cidade de Bom Jesus da Penha-MG, CEP: 37.948-000<br>2. <strong>LOTE MATRIZ: </strong>origem no&nbsp; livro n&deg; 02, Folha 01<strong>, </strong>M-12777, LOTE 05, do CRI de Nova Resende-MG<br>3. <strong>MODALIDADE DA REGULARIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O: </strong>Reurb-E<br>4. <strong>RESPONSABILIDADE DE OBRAS E SERVI&Ccedil;OS:</strong> Desnecess&aacute;ria, tendo em vista que o lote j&aacute; possui a infraetrutura essencial para aprova&ccedil;&atilde;o do requerimento, a saber, encontram-se em &aacute;rea urbanizada, possuindo energia el&eacute;trica, &aacute;gua, passeio, pavimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o asf&aacute;ltica, servi&ccedil;o de recolhimento de lixo, sistema de liga&ccedil;&atilde;o de esgoto.<br>5. <strong>PROJETO T&Eacute;CNICO DA REGULARIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O: </strong>Segue em anexo.<br>6. <strong>LOTES REGULARIZADOS: </strong>O lote regularizado &eacute; o que faz parte do memorial descritivo, aprovado no projeto de regulariza&ccedil;&atilde;o, sendo o Lote 05, da Quadra JB, constante da Matricula 12777, do CRI de Nova Resende, com &aacute;rea de 288,30 m&sup2;, situado no endere&ccedil;o RUA AMADO EVANGELISTA, bairro NOVO HORIZONTE, na cidade de BOM JESUS DA PENHA, Minas Gerais, com limites e confronta&ccedil;&otilde;es descritas no processo anexo, pendente de titula&ccedil;&atilde;o conforme situa&ccedil;&atilde;o atual, concedendo, por Legitima&ccedil;&atilde;o Fundi&aacute;ria, a titula&ccedil;&atilde;o ao Sr IVANEY FERREIRA CARDOSO, conforme requerido. <br>7. A presente Certid&atilde;o vai acompanhada dos documentos oficiais e c&oacute;pia do procedimento administrativo.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\"><!--[e