; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">E 337.582,19m </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">; deste segue com azimute de 77&deg;48\'14,09\" por uma dist&acirc;ncia de 7,00m, at&eacute; o ponto </span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">PT-19</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">, de coordenadas </span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">N 7.648.788,87m </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">e </span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">E 337.589,03m </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">; deste segue com azimute de 103&deg;52\'19,11\" por uma dist&acirc;ncia de 19,20m, at&eacute; o ponto </span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: PT-